'''Lightning''' (formerly known as '''[[Rumble]]''') is a {{Legendary}} [[Elemental]]-type [[Blox Fruit]] that costs {{Money|2,100,000}} or {{Robux|2,100}} from the [[Blox Fruit Dealer]].

Lightning grants the user the ability to create, become and manipulate lightning. This allows them to summon rumbling thunderstorms capable of paralyzing their enemies. The user can also move at lightning-fast speeds, effectively teleporting across the battlefield.

