==Trivia== 
* [[Ashen]] is the first boss to utilize the reworked Lightning [[Blox Fruits|fruit]].
* Lightning is the only fruit to be completely negated via immunity, said fruit being [[Rubber]].
** [[Rubber]] users are also immune to the stuns, not just damage.
* Lightning is the only fruit that does not display a full cooldown with its move {{Ability|Z}} and {{Ability|F}}.
* Before the release of [[Updates/27.0|Update 27.0]], players who had Rumble fully awakened (V2) received three upgrades on the [[Admin Panel]] for free.
* Before its rework, Lightning was used almost exclusively as a stun support for [[Swords]] and [[Guns]].
* The reworked version of Lightning combines aspects from the old V1 and V2 of Rumble. 
** The '''[X] Thunderstorm''' resembling the V1 '''[X] Sky Thunder''', while functioning like V2.
** The '''[C] Sky Judgement''' being a much stronger and faster version of V1 '''[C] Sky Beam'''.
** The '''[V] Thunderball Destruction''' having V2's size and startup, but taking V1's '''[V] Thunder Bomb''' speed and range.
* [[Rumble]] [[raids]] are the first and only raids to be removed from ''Blox Fruits'' entirely (previously the [[Swords|sword]] [[Pole (2nd Form)]] was inaccessible after the removal of [[Rumble]] [[raids]], but now it can be obtained by getting struck by a lightning in [[Rough Sea]] while holding [[Pole (1st Form)]].
* All of Lightning’s moves are all redesigned and reworked Awakened [[Rumble]].
* Lightning has four reskin variants — {{Skin|Yellow}}, {{Skin|Purple}}, {{Skin|Green}} and {{Skin|Red}}. Each one is considered a separate [[Blox Fruits|fruit]] and has its own distinct physical appearance.
** Upon eating any Lightning [[Blox Fruits|fruit]] [[Skins|skin]], the user is granted the corresponding permanent {{CHROMATIC}} [[skins|skin]].
* {{Ability|V}} is the first ever ability in Blox Fruits to have five variants; all scaled between orb usage from 0-4 orbs.
* Charging {{Ability|X}} with 3-4 Z1 orbs can [[stun]] [[Enemies|NPCs]] for over 10 seconds, allowing the user to use [[Fighting Styles|fighting style]] M1s on them to deal extra damage. This is good for grinding since it can easily kill a group of enemies.
* When using {{Ability|F}}, a distinct 'pop' sound effect, almost like a bubble, can be heard.
* Due to a glitch, Lightning's cosmetic orbs do not appear in the [[Dungeons|Dungeon]] Hub.
* A fully charged {{Ability|V}} can almost cover the entirety of the [[Jungle]].
* The user can eat any of the Lightning [[skins]] for the final research challenge (Conductor's Resonance). They will receive the [[Lightning/Skins|skin]],  and the [[Quests|quest]] will be completed.
* The lightning ring of {{Ability|V}} stays in place when moving in a [[Boats|boat]].
* The {{Ability|TAP}} skill of this fruit causes great amounts of FPS lag if held for over a minute. (This can be used to badly lag servers in some cases)
* Lightning's {{Ability|Z}} + {{Ability|X}} is the single highest ranged attack in the entire game, being able to hit across entire islands.
* Even after the name change, most players still call it Rumble.
* There is a glitch where if you use {{Ability|Lightning|F}} until the player uses all of the charges, and then quickly activate V3, the player will gain a few more charges, making this good for escaping PvP.
* Lightning's [[Elemental|Elemental Reflex]] has no SFX.
* The non-upgraded Z3 move can chain and damage nearby enemies, which is very useful in grinding and consists of no cooldowns.
* Lightning's obtainment was disabled outside of the events and using {{Robux|Robux}}, up until {{Update|29.3}}, where it was finally made obtainable via natural spawning, and the [[Blox Fruit Gacha]].
* There is currently an un-released '''White Lightning''' [[Skins|skin]], only being teased by rip_indra. The skin is primarily white, with '''''black''''' accents, making it the only color besides {{Skin|Purple}} and Default to have two shades.
* Lightning is highly recommended when doing sea events due to the large aoe and how fast the ability '''[X] Thunderstorm''' can kill a [[Sea Beast|Sea beasts]]. 
* Every since this fruit got reworked, it's trading value increased significantly, but currently value is unstable. 
